# 2. Enterprise MLflow Architecture ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

Imagine:

```text
100 ML Engineers
20,000 Training Runs / Month
500 Registered Models
99.9% Availability Target
```

A production-style architecture:

```text
                ML Engineers / Pipelines
                          │
                          ▼
                  Identity / SSO
                          │
                          ▼
                Load Balancer / TLS
                          │
             ┌────────────┼────────────┐
             ▼            ▼            ▼
         MLflow-1     MLflow-2     MLflow-3
             │            │            │
             └────────────┼────────────┘
                          │
                ┌─────────┴─────────┐
                ▼                   ▼
           PostgreSQL HA       Object Storage
                │                   │
           Metadata             Model Files
           Registry             Reports
           Metrics              Artifacts

       + Monitoring / Logging / Alerting
       + Secrets / RBAC / Audit Logging
       + Backup / Disaster Recovery
```

All MLflow instances must use the same logical backend database and shared artifact storage.

### Mental Model

```text
MLflow Instances
       ↓
Replaceable Application Layer

PostgreSQL
       ↓
Persistent Metadata

Object Storage
       ↓
Persistent Model Artifacts
```

**Important:** Application-tier HA is not complete platform HA. Every critical shared dependency needs its own availability and recovery strategy.

