# 5. Artifact Storage Reliability ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

The Artifact Store contains actual files.

Examples:

```text
model.pkl
MLmodel
requirements.txt
evaluation.json
confusion_matrix.png
serialized_pipeline.pkl
```

Production deployments commonly use object storage.

Examples:

```text
Amazon S3
OCI Object Storage
Azure Blob Storage
Google Cloud Storage
```

### Architecture

```text
MLflow Registry
      ↓
Model Version 12
      ↓
Artifact URI
      ↓
Object Storage
      ↓
Actual Model Files
```

### Production Considerations

- Object durability.
- Storage availability.
- IAM permissions.
- Encryption and KMS permissions.
- Object versioning.
- Backup or replication.
- Retention policies.
- Capacity and cost.
- Upload/download success rates.

### Important Lesson

> A model version existing in the Registry does not guarantee its artifact can be downloaded.

