# 13. Backup Strategy ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

Imagine the entire MLflow environment is lost.

What must we recover?

```text
Production MLflow
       │
       ├── PostgreSQL Metadata
       │
       ├── Model Artifacts
       │
       ├── MLflow Configuration
       │
       ├── Infrastructure Definitions
       │
       └── Secrets / Identity Configuration
```

### PostgreSQL Backup

Protects:

```text
Experiments
Runs
Metrics
Parameters
Registry Versions
Aliases
```

### Artifact Backup

Protects:

```text
Model Files
Evaluation Reports
Plots
Serialized Pipelines
```

### Configuration Backup

Protects or enables reconstruction of:

```text
MLflow Settings
Storage Endpoints
Infrastructure Configuration
Network Policies
Access Configuration
```

### Important

> PostgreSQL metadata and model artifacts must be recoverable to a mutually consistent state.

Restoring metadata without the corresponding artifacts may leave registered models unusable.

