A production MLflow recovery procedure might look like:

```text
Disaster Declared
        ↓
Assess Impact
        ↓
Select Recovery Point
        ↓
Restore PostgreSQL
        ↓
Restore / Verify Artifacts
        ↓
Restore Configuration
        ↓
Start MLflow Servers
        ↓
Validate Tracking API
        ↓
