# 17. Validating Disaster Recovery ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

Restoring databases and storage is not enough.

We must verify functionality.

### Test 1 — Tracking

Can we create a new experiment or run?

### Test 2 — Registry

Can we retrieve registered model versions and aliases?

### Test 3 — Artifact Access

Can we download a model artifact?

### Test 4 — Model Loading

```python
import mlflow

model = mlflow.pyfunc.load_model(
    "models:/sre-incident-predictor@champion"
)
```

### Test 5 — Prediction

```python
prediction = model.predict(
    input_example
)
```

This checks the end-to-end recovery path.

```text
MLflow API
    ↓
Registry Metadata
    ↓
Artifact Location
    ↓
Artifact Access
    ↓
Model Loading
    ↓
Prediction
```

**Important:** The test must use valid model input and a compatible inference environment.

